    affiliation = "Daugelat, Melissa Claire Universitätsklinikum und Medizinische Fakultät Tübingen, Department of Psychosomatic Medicine and Psychotherapy, Tubingen, Germany; Gregg, Bettina Centre of Excellence for Eating Disorders (KOMET), Tubingen, Germany; Adam, Sophia Helen Lived Experience Representative, Tubingen, Germany; Schag, Kathrin Eberhard Karls Universität Tübingen, Department of Psychology, Tubingen, Germany; Kimmerle, Joachim Leibniz-Institut für Wissensmedien, Tubingen, Germany; Giel, Katrin Elisabeth German Center for Mental Health (DZPG), Tubingen, Germany",
